[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069] --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   step_069: Joint axis-permutation global significance.
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   Every channel in this paper is conditioned on a direction on the sky:
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   the TNO cluster, the comet rotation residual, the implied proper-time
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   slip, the Warsaw inbound leg, and the aphelion dipole are each
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   significant about their pre-declared axes.  What has not been computed
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   is the probability that a single arbitrary direction reproduces the
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   JOINT anomaly across all populations and catalogues at once.
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   This step permutes the axis -- the one variable common to every
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   channel.  For each of N random sky directions the full battery is
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   recomputed about that direction:
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   C1  rotation channel : Mann-Whitney contrast of the CODE matched
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   unexplained slip (dtau residual, in-cap vs out-of-cap)
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   C2  dipole channel   : mean projection of pooled comet aphelia onto
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   the trial direction
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   C3  inbound channel  : Mann-Whitney contrast of the Warsaw
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   inbound-leg unexplained slip
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   C4  resident channel : mean projection of detached-TNO aphelia onto
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   the trial direction
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   C5  cluster channel  : Rayleigh test of the detached-TNO varpi
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   directions inside the trial cap
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   The five channel p-values are combined by Fisher's statistic
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   S = -2 sum ln p.  Because every draw uses the same data and changes
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   only the axis, the null distribution of S is exact for the combined
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   statistic and requires no independence assumption between channels.
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   The global p is the fraction of random directions whose combined
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   statistic reaches the value measured at the observed axis.
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   Evaluated at both pre-declared axes: the TNO cluster axis
[2026-09-20 11:22:45 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 069]   (49,-17) and the Warsaw-discovery comet axis (34,-13).
